Jawaban singkat: **Belum ada yang persis seperti Hermes Agent di Cloudflare**, tapi Cloudflare punya **Agents SDK** yang arahnya sama — stateful AI agents dengan persistent memory, scheduling, dan WebSocket.

Perbedaan utama: Hermes Agent = self-hosted di VPS/komputer lokal. Cloudflare Agents = serverless di edge Cloudflare.

---

# PERBANDINGAN: Hermes Agent vs Cloudflare Agents

| Fitur | Hermes Agent | Cloudflare Agents |
|-------|-------------|-------------------|
| **Hosting** | Self-hosted (VPS, lokal) | Serverless (Cloudflare edge) |
| **Memory** | Persistent (MEMORY.md, skills) | Persistent (SQLite di Durable Objects) |
| **Platform** | Telegram, Discord, Slack, WhatsApp, CLI | WebSocket, HTTP, Chat, Voice, Email |
| **Tools** | 40+ built-in + auto-create | Browser, Sandbox, MCP, AI Search, Payments |
| **Scheduling** | Cron built-in | Alarms + scheduling |
| **Sub-agents** | Parallel sub-agents | Fibers (durable execution) |
| **Learning** | Auto-create skills from experience | Manual skill definition |
| **Code execution** | Terminal, Docker, SSH, Modal | Sandbox SDK (isolated) |
| **Cost** | VPS + LLM API | Free tier available, pay-per-use |

