# CARA RUNNING AGENT DI CLOUDFLARE

## 1. Quick Start (3 Commands)

```bash
# 1. Create agent starter
npx create-cloudflare@latest --template cloudflare/agents-starter

# 2. Install
cd agents-starter && npm install

# 3. Run local dev
npm run dev
```

**Starter includes:**
- Streaming AI chat
- Server-side dan client-side tools
- Human-in-the-loop approval
- Task scheduling

---

## 2. Struktur Project

```
agents-starter/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts          # Worker entry point
│   ├── agent.ts          # Agent class definition
│   └── tools.ts          # Custom tools
├── wrangler.jsonc        # Config (bindings, AI, D1, etc.)
