## 6. Cara Kasih Prompting ke Agent

### A. System Prompt (Definisi Personality)
```typescript
systemPrompt = `
  Kamu adalah [nama agent] — [role description].

  Personality:
  - [trait 1]
  - [trait 2]

  Rules:
  1. [rule 1]
  2. [rule 2]

  Capabilities:
  - [capability 1]
  - [capability 2]
`;
```

### B. Dynamic Prompting (per-request)
